WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.671
Hi, my name is Eric and I am a current
senior studying in Business Administration,

2
00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.607
which means I spend a lot of time here
at the Tepper School of Business.

3
00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:09.275
One of my favorite things about the Tepper

4
00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.778
is just how many clubs
they offer to their students.

5
00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.980
I have a real passion
for financial literacy,

6
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.615
which is why I joined Moneythink.

7
00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.885
Moneythink
is a business organization where we teach

8
00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:22.922
local high school students about financial
literacy topics such as taxes,

9
00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:27.994
stocks, investing, saving, credit
and relationships with banks.

10
00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:32.265
As a member of Moneythink,
I was able to visit various local

11
00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:37.265
Pittsburgh high schools and conduct lessons
and presentations to high school students.

12
00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:40.740
Eventually,
I became the Director of Marketing, where

13
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:44.844
I led our marketing efforts in promoting
our yearly ideathon called FINNOVATION.

14
00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:46.713
During FINNOVATION,

15
00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:50.216
student groups are given
a financial literacy problem and tasked

16
00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:55.155
with creating a solution through various
different apps, products or websites.

17
00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:56.956
What I really like about Moneythink is that

18
00:00:56.956 --> 00:01:00.593
I'm able to build upon
my own knowledge of financial literacy

19
00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.630
as well as pass it down to high schoolers
who are just starting to

20
00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:07.434
think about their own finances as well
as preparing to save up for college.

